<title>USA: South Alabama to acquire Peterman State.</title>
<headline>South Alabama to acquire Peterman State.</headline>
<dateline>MOBILE. ALA. 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Alabama Bancorp Inc said Friday that it has agreed in principle to acquire privately-held Peterman State Bank, subject to shareholder and regulator proposal.</p>
<p>South Alabama said that Peterman shareholders will receive stock equal to 1.3 times the adjusted book value of Peterman at the date of the merger.</p>
<p>Peterman has assets of $20 million and is based in Peterman Ala. South Alabama has assets of $348 million.</p>
</text>
